## Summary
Udemy Business introduces an update for subscribers focused on building measurable talent pipelines using the Google Certificates Collection. It addresses the lack of visibility for organizations investing in AI and digital transformation regarding employee skill development. The update targets L&D leaders, CHROs, and CIOs to enhance workforce development strategies.

## Key Points
- Organizations are heavily investing in AI and digital transformation.
- There is a significant gap in visibility into whether employees have the necessary skills for business impact.
- Workforce development is a critical concern for L&D leaders, CHROs, and CIOs.
- The Google Certificates Collection is presented as a solution for building measurable talent pipelines.
- The update is exclusive to Udemy Business subscribers, highlighting targeted professional development.


